    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oh no! Pachiko, the mascot of the Shige Channel, is up to mischief again!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've found yourself trapped in a mysterious looping space.<br>Observe your surroundings carefully. If there\u2019s nothing unusual, proceed toward the exit (blue sign).<br>If you sense anything strange, head toward the interior of the building (orange sign).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choosing the correct path appears to move time forward.<br>Hang in there until 8 o\u2019clock...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201c\uff18\u309c\u5b50 / Pachiko\u201d is a game inspired by \u201cExit 8,\u201d where you search for strange anomalies in a looping environment.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Estimated Playtime</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 30 to 60 minutes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move: WASD + Mouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run: Hold Shift</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menu: ESC / E</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The same anomaly will not appear again until all other anomalies have been discovered.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Video Streaming Guidelines</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to upload or stream gameplay videos without prior permission, whether as an individual or organization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is allowed only when using official monetization features provided by video sharing platforms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including the game\u2019s title in the video thumbnail or stream title, and linking to the Steam store page in the description, would be greatly appreciated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are not responsible for any damages or issues arising from gameplay videos or livestreams of this game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>These guidelines are subject to change without notice.</i></p>",
